  "(2026-11-06) Outside the window (Nov-Dec 2027) the PDF also lists: Ministerial Spouses Fall Gathering 6 Nov, Friends Day 13 Nov, TLT Retreat 19-21 Nov, Laity Festival 4 and 11 Dec, Haitian Half-Day Prayer and Fasting 28 Nov and 26 Dec.",
